/* 版式照实验动物订购页「订单记录」：页签条 / 筛选按钮 / 可收起筛选 / 表格（横向滚动走 CSS）。
   ord-* 这组规则是从 package-feature/pages/animalOrder/index.wxss 抄的同一套值，保持两边观感一致。 */

.orders,
.orders view,
.orders scroll-view,
.orders text,
.orders input {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.orders {
  height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: #eef0f6;
}

.ord-bar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 20rpx;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #eef0f4;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  background: #fff;
}
.ord-tabs {
  display: flex;
  background: #f1f3f7;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  padding: 4rpx;
}
.ord-tab {
  padding: 8rpx 20rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #334155;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
}
.ord-tab-on {
  background: #fff;
  color: #1f2937;
  font-weight: 600;
  box-shadow: 0 1rpx 4rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
}
.ord-count {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #94a3b8;
  margin-left: auto;
}
.ord-btn {
  padding: 10rpx 26rpx;
  background: #f1f3f7;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #1f2937;
}
.ord-btn-primary {
  background: #2563eb;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.ord-btn-off {
  background: #e5e7eb;
  color: #9aa0a6;
}

.ord-filters {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 20rpx;
  background: #f6f7fb;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #eef0f4;
}
.ord-field {
  width: calc(50% - 8rpx);
}
.ord-field-wide {
  width: 100%;
}
.ord-flabel {
  display: block;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #94a3b8;
  margin-bottom: 6rpx;
}
.ord-finput {
  height: 64rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  padding: 0 16rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid #e5e7eb;
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  background: #fff;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #1f2937;
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.ord-filter-actions {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.orders-scroll {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 20rpx 32rpx;
}

.ord-table-wrap {
  width: 100%;
  overflow-x: auto;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 14rpx rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #fff;
}
.ord-table {
  padding-bottom: 8rpx;
}
.ord-tr {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #eef0f4;
}
.ord-tr-head {
  background: #f6f7fb;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #334155;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.ord-td {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  padding: 14rpx 12rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #1f2937;
  word-break: break-all;
}
.ord-td.mono {
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  color: #94a3b8;
}
.w-no {
  width: 200rpx;
}
.w-item {
  width: 300rpx;
}
.w-xs {
  width: 110rpx;
  text-align: center;
}
.w-mid {
  width: 160rpx;
}
.w-pi {
  width: 150rpx;
}
.w-group {
  width: 240rpx;
}
.w-date {
  width: 220rpx;
}
.w-remark {
  width: 320rpx;
}

/* 触底提示必须留在滚动区内部（放外面会让滚动区高度变化 → 微信重置 scrollTop，一触底就跳回顶部） */
.ord-foot {
  padding: 28rpx 0 calc(20rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #94a3b8;
}

.muted {
  padding: 80rpx 0;
  text-align: center;
  color: #94a3b8;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}
.muted.pad {
  padding: 48rpx 24rpx;
}

/* 日期：一行两枚内容宽度 chip（点开 van-datetime-picker 弹层），不再是两个超长输入框 */
.ord-range {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.ord-chip {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8rpx;
  min-height: 64rpx;
  padding: 0 18rpx;
  background: #f7f8fa;
  border: 1rpx solid #e5e7eb;
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #1f2937;
}
.ord-chip-x {
  padding: 0 4rpx;
  color: #94a3b8;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 1;
}
.ord-range-sep {
  color: #94a3b8;
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

/* 分段控件（单次 / 多次，与小程序其它页同款：实底、直角、无描边） */
.ord-seg { display: flex; background: #f1f3f7; border-radius: 10rpx; padding: 4rpx; }
.ord-seg-i { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 12rpx 0; font-size: 26rpx; color: #334155; border-radius: 8rpx; }
.ord-seg-on { background: #2563eb; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }

/* 单据摘要条 */
.ord-summary { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12rpx 24rpx; padding: 16rpx 20rpx; margin-bottom: 12rpx; background: #fff; border-radius: 12rpx; }
.ord-sum-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4rpx; min-width: 180rpx; }
.ord-sum-k { font-size: 22rpx; color: #94a3b8; }

/* 日期 chip（内容宽度，一行两枚，可单独清除） */
.ord-range { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12rpx; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.ord-chip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8rpx; min-height: 64rpx; padding: 0 18rpx; background: #f7f8fa; border: 1rpx solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10rpx; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 26rpx; color: #1f2937; }
.ord-chip-x { padding: 0 4rpx; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 28rpx; line-height: 1; }
.ord-range-sep { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 24rpx; }

/* 领用还原行（无流水、按申领补录出来的那类）淡紫底，与流水行区分 */
.ord-tr-restored { background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.04); }
